OL,3,GNEWSACommission to hold final round of
OL,4,Ameetings on Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Parades Commission is to hold a
OL,7,Ffinal round of meetings on Wednesday
OL,8,Fbefore coming to a decision on the
OL,9,FDrumcree dispute.
OL,11,FThe five-person commission must decide
OL,12,Fwhether to allow the Orange Order to
OL,13,Fmarch from Drumcree church in Portadown
OL,14,Falong the mainly nationalist Garvaghy
OL,15,FRoad on Sunday.
OL,17,FIt is one of the most contentious
OL,18,Fparade routes in Northern Ireland.
OL,20,FA decision on whether or not to
OL,21,Fre-route the planned march may not be
OL,22,Fannounced until Friday.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
